    # Size, Milestone 3 part 1: 2026-10-02-6578925
    
    The stripped `i686-unknown-linux-musl` sizes of the twenty-one size probes,
    measured by `records/logs/m3p1-p3/size.log` after Milestone 3 part 1, the
    proof at scale (`specs/0023-scale.md`, "Size"). No probe changed in this
    part. The part's crate changes are P2's correctness fix, the write's refusal
    of a cell edit off the grid (8d05845de2f80a88dbd3b31fbd6f930410a0789f), and P3's catalogue block, `//!` lines
    alone (6578925ae14c9811c1bb3e064b7423c4926e0bad). The budget is the core probe, `probe-emend-format-write-xml`,
    over `probe-zip-xml`, against the ceiling Milestone 2 set and Milestone 3
    keeps (`specs/0017-fuller-styles.md`, decision 1, A). This record follows
    `records/size-m2p4d-2026-10-01-c1f6602.md`, part 4d's, which stands as history.
    
    - Commit: 6578925ae14c9811c1bb3e064b7423c4926e0bad
    - Date: 2026-10-02 (UTC)
    - Toolchain: rustc 1.98.1 (48a229cea 2026-09-01); cargo 1.98.1 (797e8a9bc 2026-08-05)
    - Target: i686-unknown-linux-musl
    - Profile: `size` in the workspace `Cargo.toml` (inherits release,
      opt-level "z", lto "fat", codegen-units 1, panic "abort", strip true,
      debug false)
    - `zip` 8.6.0, `default-features = false`, features
      `deflate-flate2-zlib-rs`; `quick-xml` 0.42.0 behind the `size-probe`
      feature `xml`; emend behind the `size-probe` feature `emend`; emend's
      `dates`, `rowcol`, `metadata`, `rules`, `tables`, `comments` and
      `images` behind the `size-probe` features of the same names
      (`["emend", "xml", "emend/<feature>"]`)
    - Each probe built alone with its own `--features` set, the manifest's
      `required-features`; the core probes and `probe-emend-format-write-xml`
      with `emend,xml`, which turns on none of the seven features (the log
      reads it off `cargo tree -e features`)
    
